# Tic-Tac-Toe AI

## Overview

Tic-Tac-Toe AI is an intelligent game application developed as part of the CodSoft Artificial Intelligence Internship. The project allows a human player to compete against an AI-powered opponent in the classic Tic-Tac-Toe game.

The AI analyzes the game board and selects optimal moves, demonstrating fundamental concepts of Artificial Intelligence, game theory, and decision-making algorithms.

## Features

* Human vs AI gameplay
* Interactive and user-friendly interface
* Automatic win, loss, and draw detection
* Intelligent AI move selection
* Responsive game board

## Technologies Used

* HTML
* CSS
* JavaScript
* Artificial Intelligence Concepts
* Minimax Algorithm (if implemented)

## How to Play

1. Open the game in a web browser.
2. The human player plays as **X**.
3. Click on an empty cell to make a move.
4. The AI responds with its move automatically.
5. The game ends when a player wins or when the board is full, resulting in a draw.

